{"id":"n61168-3-7","stage":1,"title":"드리다 · 献上","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61168-3-7-1","ko":"이곳은 어떤 곳인가요?","zh":"这里是什么地方呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳은","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이곳은","audio":"/audio/ef2adc07c274a915661b.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"곳인가요?","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳인가요","audio":"/audio/de9aa3bce1cb788932e6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]}],"audio":"/audio/e74d99952a694a6558c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61168-3-7-2","ko":"옛날 기독교인들이 예배를 드리던 장소예요.","zh":"这里是过去基督徒们做礼拜的地方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옛날","meaning":"过去，昔日","explanation":"옛날：过去，昔日。","readings":[{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57273","senseId":"2","lemma":"옛날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}},{"text":"기독교인들이","meaning":"基督徒","explanation":"기독교인：基督徒；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기독교인","audio":"/audio/9c9c034be12b0ff81e5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37955","senseId":"1","lemma":"기독교인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기독교인들이","audio":"/audio/202de4d18b8d3ae91873.mp3"}},{"text":"예배를","meaning":"礼拜","explanation":"예배：礼拜；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"예배","audio":"/audio/1b22759f0091a935628e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68452","senseId":"1","lemma":"예배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예배를","audio":"/audio/d85ddcf488528a608c6e.mp3"}},{"text":"드리던","meaning":"献上，奉上，献给","explanation":"드리다：献上，奉上，献给；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"3","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리던","audio":"/audio/eb85ebc89e6f90714513.mp3"}},{"text":"장소예요.","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장소예요","audio":"/audio/41c79853f61667457d13.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"336963582ab921f0","term":"옛날","zh":"过去，昔日","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3","entryId":"57273","definition":"以前的某一时段。","pronunciation":["옌ː날"]},{"id":"9c9c034be12b0ff8","term":"기독교인","zh":"基督徒","audio":"/audio/9c9c034be12b0ff81e5d.mp3","entryId":"37955","definition":"信仰基督教的人。","pronunciation":["기독꾜인"]},{"id":"1b22759f0091a935","term":"예배","zh":"礼拜","audio":"/audio/1b22759f0091a935628e.mp3","entryId":"68452","definition":"向神或菩萨等祈祷恭敬的仪式；或指行使那样的仪式。","pronunciation":["예배"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"献上，奉上，献给","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"向神祈祷或敬拜神的仪式。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]}],"audio":"/audio/740a3c662ef295236e33.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.863,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61168","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7494,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这里是过去基督徒们做礼拜的地方。","这里是什么地方呢？","看来是感冒了。浑身发冷呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这里是什么地方呢？","看来是感冒了。浑身发冷呢。","这里是过去基督徒们做礼拜的地方。"],"answer":2}]}
